<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SPANISH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Spanish first division matches on Sunday:</p>
<p>Celta Vigo 4 (Milorad Ratkovic 9th, 56th minutes, Sanchez 12th, Vladimir Gudelj 74th Sevilla 2 (Rafa Paz 69th, Ivica Mornar 81st). Halftime 2-0. Attendance 18,000.</p>
<p>Deportivo Coruna 4 (Javier Manjarin 29th, Rivaldo 32nd, Corentine Martins, 52nd, Armando Alvarez 79th) Logrones 1 (Francisco Castano 41st). 2-1. 20,000.</p>
<p>Hercules 1 (Manuel Alfaro 52nd pen) Compostela 0. 0-0. 15,000.</p>
<p>Real Betis 3 (Pier Cherubino 60th, George Finidi 67th, 90th) Tenerife 1 (Sebastian Chano 30th). 0-1. 43,000.</p>
<p>Rayo Vallecano 1 (Stjepan Andrijasevic 34th) Zaragoza 1 (Fernando Morientes 52nd). 1-0. 10,000.</p>
<p>Oviedo 0 Real Sociedad 0. 13,000.</p>
<p>Espanyol 0 Racing Santander 0. 25,000.</p>
<p>Real Madrid 4 (Davor Suker 19th, 24th, 60th, Raul Gonzalez 75th) Valencia 2 (Valery Karpin 12th, Gaizka Mednieta pen, 89th). 2-1. 95,000.</p>
